@startuml
title A3 - Settle competing requests for one resource (UC-M4-06, FR-11.M4.1)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
start
:Collect the requests that want the same vehicle,\nparking space or charging bay;
:Give each request a class level (BR-M4-01);
:Sort by class level, then request time, then request ID;\n(inside the charging class: BR-M3-03);
:Take the first request;
:Try to claim the resource in one atomic step\n(version check in Core);
if (Claim succeeded?) then (yes)
  :Grant the resource;
else (no, another claim was committed first)
  :Answer conflict with the reason;
endif
while (More requests?) is (yes)
  :Answer conflict with the reason;
  :Offer an alternative Hub if one exists (UC-M4-05);
endwhile (no)
:Log every decision with its reason (BR-M4-12);
stop
@enduml
